.TH BAMBU\-STUDIO 1 "November 2026" "bambustudio" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
bambu\-studio \- slicing software for Bambu Lab 3D printers
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B bambu\-studio
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] [\fIFILE\fR ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Bambu Studio is a feature\-rich slicing application based on PrusaSlicer.
It supports project\-based workflows, multiple plates, hybrid/tree supports,
multi\-material printing and remote printer control.
.PP
Printing via SD card works without any optional plugin. The non\-free Bambu
networking plugin is not included in this package.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/share/BambuStudio
Read\-only application resources (profiles, images, translations).
.TP
.I /usr/lib/x86_64\-linux\-gnu/bambu\-studio
Application binary and bundled FFmpeg libraries.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR https://github.com/bambulab/BambuStudio
.SH AUTHOR
Bambu Lab, based on PrusaSlicer by Prusa Research and Slic3r by Alessandro
Ranellucci.
